sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as StartAnalysis<br/>«view»
    participant DC as DatasetController<br/>«controller»
    participant AC as AnalysisController<br/>«controller»
    participant AS as AnalysisService<br/>«service»
    participant DP as DatasetCsvParser<br/>«service»

    opt download template
        U->>FE: click "Download CSV template"
        FE->>DC: GET /api/datasets/template
        DC-->>FE: 200 OK (text,url,language)
    end

    U->>FE: choose CSV file (≤10MB)
    FE->>AC: POST /api/brands/{brandId}/reports/csv (file upload)
    AC->>AS: startAnalysisFromCsv(brandId, file, dateRange)
    AS->>DP: parse(file)
    alt valid CSV
        DP-->>AS: parsed posts
        AS->>AS: persist Posts + Report (status=QUEUED)
        AS-->>AC: ReportResponse
        AC-->>FE: 200 OK
        FE-->>U: navigate to /reports/{id}
        Note over AS: async LLM flow same as start-analysis
    else parse / validation error
        DP-->>AS: DatasetValidationException
        AC-->>FE: 400 with errors[]
        FE-->>U: show field-level error table
    end
